        "title": "Quickstart",
        "content": "<p>Minimal path from <code>pip install</code> to first backtest. For the longer walkthrough with metrics interpretation, see <a href=\"../tutorials/01-install-first-backtest.md\">Tutorial 1</a>. For every other topic, see the <a href=\"../README.md\">Documentation Index</a>.</p>\n<h4>Install</h4>\n<h4>Download data</h4>\n<p>Free, no API keys. Funding rates from 7 venues auto-fetch for any <code>-PERP</code> market.</p>\n<h4>Run a backtest</h4>\n<p>The response returns a <code>id</code>; poll <code>/api/v1/backtest/{id}/results</code> until <code>status == \"complete\"</code>.</p>\n<p>Or use the UI — BacktestLab → <strong>Momentum</strong> → pick a date range → <strong>Run</strong>.</p>\n<h4>Key metrics</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sharpe</strong> — risk-adjusted return. <code>>1.0</code> interesting, <code>>2.0</code> suspicious.</li>\n<li><strong>Max drawdown</strong> — worst peak-to-trough drop. <code><20%</code> tolerable.</li>\n<li><strong>Profit factor</strong> — gross wins ÷ gross losses. <code>>1.5</code> strong.</li>\n<li><strong>Monte Carlo P5</strong> — pessimistic worst case over 500 bootstraps.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Full definitions: <a href=\"../reference/metrics.md\">reference/metrics.md</a>.</p>\n<h4>Optimize</h4>\n<p>Requires a <code>parameters()</code> classmethod on the strategy. Walkthrough: <a href=\"../tutorials/03-optimize-walk-forward.md\">Tutorial 3</a>.</p>\n<h4>Walk-forward</h4>\n<p>Always validate an optimization with walk-forward before deploying:</p>\n<p>Overfitting ratio <code>≥ 0.5</code> = usable; <code>< 0.3</code> = severely overfit.</p>\n<h4>Deploy to paper</h4>\n<p>On any backtest result, click <strong>Deploy to Paper</strong> (UI) or:</p>\n<p>Run paper for 2–4 weeks before live. Full flow: <a href=\"../tutorials/04-paper-to-live.md\">Tutorial 4</a>.</p>\n<h4>MCP (AI integration)</h4>\n<p>20 tools exposed to Claude Code / other MCP clients. See <a href=\"../reference/mcp-tools.md\">reference/mcp-tools.md</a>.</p>\n<h4>Next steps</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Author a custom strategy</strong> → <a href=\"../tutorials/02-author-a-strategy.md\">Tutorial 2</a></li>\n<li><strong>Understand the architecture</strong> → <a href=\"../concepts/architecture.md\">concepts/architecture.md</a></li>\n<li><strong>Go live on Hyperliquid</strong> → <a href=\"../tutorials/04-paper-to-live.md\">Tutorial 4</a> + <a href=\"../validation/devnet-testing-guide.md\">validation/devnet-testing-guide.md</a></li>\n<li><strong>Full docs index</strong> → <a href=\"../README.md\">docs/README.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>CLI cheat sheet</h4>\n<p>Full reference: <a href=\"../reference/cli.md\">reference/cli.md</a>.</p>",
